      "speaker": null,
      "text": "187. The verb ἀνίσταμαι, ‘I get up and go, leave, emigrate’ (stem ἀνιστα-), conjugates in the same way as δύναμαι, ‘I am able, can’ (177):",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
